<p>When documents containing a mixture of landscape and portrait pages 
 are printed, document pages whose orientation differs from the paper orientation 
 are printed rotated by 90 degrees. Click to select the direction to which 
 you want to rotate those pages.</p>
<p>Available functions differ depending on the printer or printer driver you are using.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="result" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Printout Result:</span></p>
<p>Select a printout result.</p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Printer Defaults</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">When applying 2 sided printing or stapling, use 
 this setting to specify the print direction settings correctly. </p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Rotate to a naturally readable direction</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">Landscape pages within portrait documents are rotated 
 by 90 degrees leftward for printing. Likewise, portrait pages within landscape 
 documents are rotated by 90 degrees rightward.</p>
<p aria-level="4" class="T3" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Rotate to reverse readable direction</span></p>
<p class="Normal-indent">Landscape pages within portrait documents are rotated 
 by 90 degrees rightward for printing. Likewise, portrait pages within 
 landscape documents are rotated by 90 degrees leftward.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="ok" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">OK</span></p>
<p>Saves the changes and closes the dialog box.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="cancel" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Cancel</span></p>
<p>Closes the dialog box without saving any changes.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="default" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Restore Defaults</span></p>
<p>Restores the settings on this dialog box to the default settings.</p>
<p aria-level="3" class="T2" id="help" role="heading"><span class="Term-Soft">Help</span></p>
<p>Displays Help for the dialog box opened.</p>
